# RFCs

Use RFCs for proposals that need discussion before they become OpenSpec changes, ADRs, or implementation tasks.

## When To Create An RFC

- The problem is broad enough that design alternatives need comparison.
- Stakeholders need to agree on scope, rollout, or compatibility.
- The idea is not ready to become an OpenSpec change.

## Template

Copy `.agent/templates/rfc.md.tmpl` into this directory with a sortable name such as `0001-proposal-title.md`.

